ent-BookBase = 書 | book
    .desc = 一本精裝書。 | A hardcover book.
ent-BaseGuidebook = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
    .suffix = guidebook
ent-BookSpaceEncyclopedia = 太空百科全書 | space encyclopedia
    .desc = 一部蘊含所有知識的百科全書。這部百科全書的作者不詳。 | An encyclopedia containing all the knowledge. The author of this encyclopedia is unknown.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookTheBookOfControl = 《控制之書》 | the book of control
    .desc = 這是變得堅韌不可或缺的。 | Essential to become robust.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookBartendersManual = 調酒師手冊 | bartender's manual
    .desc = 這本手冊上有啤酒漬。 | This manual is stained with beer.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookHowToCookForFortySpaceman = 如何為四十名太空人做飯 | How To Cook For Forty Spacemen
    .desc = 一本由太空廚師所寫的烹飪書。 | A book about cooking written by a space chef.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookLeafLoversSecret = 葉子愛好者的秘密 | leaf lover's secret
    .desc = 它散發著濃烈的雜草氣味。這會激勵你進行施肥和播種。 | It has a strong weed smell. It motivates you to feed and seed.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookEngineersHandbook = 工程師手冊 | engineer's handbook
    .desc = 由 Nanotrasen 撰寫的一本關於工程部的手冊。 | A handbook about engineering written by Nanotrasen.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookScientistsGuidebook = 科學家指南 | scientist's guidebook
    .desc = 由 Nanotrasen 撰寫的一本關於科學的指南。 | A guidebook about science written by Nanotrasen.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookSecurity = 資安入門 | security 101
    .desc = 一本由納諾特森所撰寫的安全相關書籍。書上沾滿了血跡，看來它被當作武器使用的次數，似乎比當作閱讀材料還要多。 | A book about security written by Nanotrasen. The book is stained with blood. It seems to have been used more as a weapon than reading material.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookHowToKeepStationClean = 如何保持太空站整潔 | how to keep station clean
    .desc = 這本書非常乾淨。 | This book is very clean.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookHowToRockAndStone = 如何玩轉岩石與石頭 | how to rock and stone
    .desc = 這是一份由傳奇太空礦工卡爾撰寫的、關於打撈作業的極為詳盡指南，不過他本人卻下落不明。這份指南會激勵你大展身手。 | A very detailed guide about salvage written by Karl, a legendary space miner, however he's missing. It motivates you to rock and stone.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookMedicalReferenceBook = 醫學參考書 | medical reference book
    .desc = 一本由一位老醫師撰寫的醫學參考書。字跡幾乎難以辨認。 | A reference book about medical written by an old doctor. The handwriting is barely comprehensible.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookHowToSurvive = 如何生存 | how to survive
    .desc = 諷刺的是，這本書的作者已經過世了。 | Ironically the author of this book is dead.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookChemicalCompendium = chempendium | chempendium
    .desc = 由某位老教授撰寫的一本關於化學合成的綜合指南。 | A comprehensive guide written by some old skeleton of a professor about chemical synthesis.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookAILawCompendium = 哎呀，機器人 | My, Robot
    .desc = 一本詳盡列出矽基體可能出錯的所有情況的辭典。作者：艾薩克・克魯西莫夫。 | A dictionary of all the ways silicons can go wrong. By Isaac Crewsimov.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookSpaceLaw = 太空法 | space law
    .desc = 一套由納諾特森（Nanotrasen）制定的、用於維護其太空站治安與秩序的準則。 | A set of Nanotrasen guidelines for keeping law and order on their space stations.
    .suffix = { ent-BaseGuidebook.suffix }
ent-BookRandom = { ent-BookBase }
    .desc = 每一本書都是獨一無二的！這本書裡藏著什麼呢？ | Each book is unique! What is hidden in this one?
    .suffix = random visual
ent-BookRandomStory = { ent-BookRandom }
    .desc = { ent-BookRandom.desc }
    .suffix = random visual, random story
ent-BookAtmosDistro = 《牛頓的大氣指南：發行版》 | Newton's Guide to Atmos: The Distro
    .desc = 頁邊潦草地寫滿了無數難以辨識的筆記。正文的大部分都被手寫的問號覆蓋了。 | There are endless illegible notes scribbled in the margins. Most of the text is covered in handwritten question marks.
ent-BookAtmosWaste = 《牛頓的《大氣》指南：廢棄物》 | Newton's Guide to Atmos: Waste
    .desc = 頁邊潦草地寫滿了無數難以辨識的筆記。正文的大部分都被手寫的問號覆蓋了。 | There are endless illegible notes scribbled in the margins. Most of the text is covered in handwritten question marks.
